<title>GERMANY: German Sept trade surplus rises to 9.8 bln DM.</title>
<headline>German Sept trade surplus rises to 9.8 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator (bln marks):</p>
<p>GERMAN TRADE/CURRENT ACC Mar 97    Feb 97	  Mar 96</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +9.8     +9.2	    +6.2</p>
<p> Current account	     +2.3     -1.5	    +2.0</p>
<p> Exports			 70.4     67.8	    65.1</p>
<p> Imports			 60.6     58.6	    58.9</p>
<p> Services			-3.8     -4.1	    -3.8</p>
<p> Wage and property income  +0.8     -1.3	    +4.1</p>
<p> Transfers		     -4.3     -5.2	    -5.0</p>
<p> Supplementary trade	 -0.2     -0.1	    +0.5</p>
</text>
